  <name>typeShi</name>
  <summary>A typing application</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      typeShi is a typing application featuring time-based, word-count-based,
      and quote-based typing tests. It includes custom Material-style themes,
      detailed performance history and streak tracking, and 1v1 Multiplayer Functionality.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Time, word count, and quote typing modes</li>
      <li>Optional punctuation and multiple word lists</li>
      <li>Live WPM, accuracy, and consistency stats</li>
      <li>Detailed history, streaks, and daily test tracking</li>
      <li>Custom themes with light/dark variants</li>
      <li>Real-time multiplayer typing races</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
